msgid "当前系统架构"
msgstr "Current system architecture"

msgid "![FIG-01：平台职责与外部产品边界](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-01: platform responsibilities and external product boundaries](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "FIG-01：平台职责与外部产品边界"
msgstr "FIG-01: platform responsibilities and external product boundaries"

msgid "图表达通用职责和构建／调用关系，本轮 MCU 入口为 F4。可选 OS 与组件不是每次 I/O 的强制中间层；物理验收另行取得。"
msgstr "The diagram describes generic responsibilities and build/call relationships. The MCU entry point in this iteration is F4. Optional OS and components are not mandatory intermediaries on each I/O call; physical acceptance is obtained separately."

msgid "目录、状态与资源"
msgstr "Directories, state and resources"

msgid "位置"
msgstr "Location"

msgid "责任与所有者"
msgstr "Responsibility and owner"

msgid "`core/`"
msgstr "`core/`"

msgid "结果、单调 deadline、请求与借用规则、整平台启动、停止、暂停与恢复协调"
msgstr "Results, monotonic deadlines, request and borrowing rules, and whole-platform startup, stop, suspend and resume coordination"

msgid "`arch/`"
msgstr "`arch/`"

msgid "编译期 CPU 原语、中断状态保存恢复和明确能力"
msgstr "Compile-time CPU primitives, interrupt-state save/restore and explicit capabilities"

msgid "`io/`"
msgstr "`io/`"

msgid "公共类型、检查分派与硬件无关机制"
msgstr "Public types, checked dispatch and hardware-independent mechanisms"

msgid "`soc/stm32/stm32f4/`"
msgstr "`soc/stm32/stm32f4/`"

msgid "精确芯片事实、启动、时钟、IRQ／DMA、私有控制器状态与 HAL／LL 适配"
msgstr "Exact chip facts, startup, clocks, IRQ/DMA, private controller state and HAL/LL adaptation"

msgid "`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/`"
msgstr "`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/`"

msgid "仍被 F4 使用的私有硬件算法，无额外运行时注册"
msgstr "Private hardware algorithms still used by F4, without extra runtime registration"

msgid "`boards/`"
msgstr "`boards/`"

msgid "四个 F407 板卡的实际接线、晶振、安全电平及未知项"
msgstr "Actual wiring, oscillators, safe levels and unknowns for four F407 boards"

msgid "`os/`"
msgstr "`os/`"

msgid "可选任务、等待、通知及明确后端合同"
msgstr "Optional tasks, waits, notifications and explicit backend contracts"

msgid "`components/`"
msgstr "`components/`"

msgid "器件协议、owner、存储、网络等显式可选机制"
msgstr "Explicit optional device protocols, owners, storage and networking mechanisms"

msgid "`tests/support/native/`"
msgstr "`tests/support/native/`"

msgid "显式测试模型、Board 与装配，不是生产 SoC"
msgstr "Explicit test models, Board and assemblies, not a production SoC"

msgid "`tools/`、`cmake/`"
msgstr "`tools/`、`cmake/`"

msgid "配置、唯一源码图、测试、SDK 与交付"
msgstr "Configuration, sole source graph, tests, SDK and delivery"

msgid "外部产品"
msgstr "External product"

msgid "任务、队列、预算、私有分区、恢复与安全政策"
msgstr "Tasks, queues, budgets, private partitions, recovery and security policies"

msgid "完整导航见[源码定位](../explanation/source-map.md)。顶层共享 MCU `drivers/` 已归入 F4，目录移动本身不改变指令数或资源成本。"
msgstr "See the [source map](../explanation/source-map.md) for full navigation. Shared MCU sources formerly under root `drivers/` now belong to F4. Moving directories alone does not change instruction counts or resource costs."

msgid "构建与运行"
msgstr "Build and execution"

msgid "一份 schema-2 TOML 和只读 SoC／Board JSON 经严格校验、资源计划和不可变 typed IR 生成原子 bundle。CMake 选择已声明的实际源码与链接依赖；生成器不维护平行源码图。"
msgstr "One schema-2 TOML file and readonly SoC/Board JSON pass strict validation, resource planning and immutable typed IR to produce an atomic bundle. CMake selects declared actual sources and link dependencies; the generator maintains no parallel source graph."

msgid "每个固件选择精确器件宏和启动文件。厂商头、Handle 和可变 provider 状态私有； 生成器按选中实例定容配置、状态、buffer、只读 face 与强类型 factory。"
msgstr "Each firmware selects an exact device macro and startup file. Vendor headers, Handles and mutable provider state remain private. The generator sizes configuration, state, buffers, readonly faces and the strongly typed factory for selected instances."

msgid "运行中 factory 只返回已有接口。日常 I/O 通过 `ops(context, ...)` 直接进入 F4 实现，硬件操作优先复用官方 HAL／LL。不会因共享源码引入最大池、动态注册表、 默认堆或隐藏 worker。应用负责串行执行者、服务进度和 scheduler 启动。"
msgstr "At runtime the factory only returns existing interfaces. Ordinary I/O calls enter F4 implementations directly through `ops(context, ...)`, preferring official HAL/LL operations. Shared source introduces no maximum-sized pool, dynamic registry, default heap or hidden worker. Applications own serialized execution, service progress and scheduler startup."

msgid "生命周期与失败"
msgstr "Lifecycle and failure"

msgid "F4 C 实现维护资源准入、取得、收条、硬件撤回和 readback。部分取得失败必须处理 当前步骤已经产生的效果，再逆序撤回前序步骤；失败释放保留实际责任。"
msgstr "F4 C implementations maintain resource admission, acquisition, receipts, hardware withdrawal and readback. A partially failed acquisition must handle effects already produced by the current step before reversing earlier steps. Failed release retains actual responsibility."

msgid "默认静态装配通过 Core 私有 `platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 使用手写 C 协调器。 公共 `nx_platform_lifecycle_start/stop/suspend/resume` 以运行期参数调用同一实现。固定装配的配置、 可选 owner 和诊断在同一编译单元可见，编译器可以裁剪恒定分支和不再需要的回调表； 产品仅包含公共接口，不增加运行时转发层或第二份算法。 全部 controller 准入先于硬件效果；随后依次建立 System、共享资源与 controller。 失败按逆序撤回，在首个释放拒绝处保留剩余责任，后续 stop 只重试未完成部分。 primary、cleanup、remaining effects 和调用期诊断独立保留，不以清理成功覆盖原始失败。 F4 的 System／DMA／SYSCFG／pins／CAN／Ethernet 共享责任由其私有 C 协调器处理。"
msgstr "The default static assembly uses a handwritten C coordinator through Core's private `platform_lifecycle_impl.h`. Public `nx_platform_lifecycle_start/stop/suspend/resume` calls the same implementation with runtime arguments. Fixed assembly configuration, optional owners and diagnostics are visible within one translation unit, allowing the compiler to remove constant branches and unused callback tables. Products include only public interfaces; no additional runtime forwarding layer or second algorithm is introduced. Every controller undergoes admission before hardware effects; System, shared resources and controllers then start in order. Failure unwinds in reverse order, retaining responsibility at the first refused release; later stop calls retry only unfinished work. Primary failure, cleanup failure, remaining effects and call-scoped diagnostics remain separate: successful cleanup never overwrites the original failure. F4's private C coordinator owns its shared System, DMA, SYSCFG, pin, CAN and Ethernet responsibilities."

msgid "暂停先由调用者 join 借用者，再逆序排空 controller 和共享资源；失败停在 SUSPENDING 并保留前缀，不能直接 resume。只有完整 SUSPENDED 才按原 plan 重取 资源和 controller；恢复失败逆序回滚，System 与原配置责任仍保留。自主 RTC 等 域通过同一 owner 的显式 suspend/resume hook 保留，不由通用协调器直接写硬件。 暂停本身不进入低功耗；STOP 的独立电源机制恢复后建立新 Core epoch，应用与 OS 重新建立 deadline，不能把暂停代次当作时间转换。详见 [System 合同](../design/f407-system-power.md)。"
msgstr "The caller joins borrowers before suspend drains controllers and shared resources in reverse order. Failure remains SUSPENDING with the retained prefix and cannot resume directly. Only a fully SUSPENDED assembly reacquires resources and controllers from the original plan. Resume failure unwinds in reverse order while retaining System and the original configuration responsibility. Autonomous domains such as RTC are preserved through the same owner's explicit suspend/resume hooks; the generic coordinator does not write their hardware. Suspend does not itself enter low power. The separate STOP mechanism creates a new Core epoch after restoring RUN; applications and the OS must recreate deadlines. A suspend generation is not a time conversion. See the [System contract](../design/f407-system-power.md)."

msgid "ACCEPTED 后借用请求与 buffer，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。DMA 完成、线上完成、 IRQ／callback 撤回和最终发布分别证明；timeout／cancel 不提前释放借用。 QUARANTINED 保留存储与恢复责任，观察者和 adapter 还需独立 join。"
msgstr "After ACCEPTED, requests and buffers remain borrowed until acquire observes SETTLED. DMA completion, wire completion, IRQ/callback withdrawal and final publication require separate proofs; timeout/cancel does not release borrows early. QUARANTINED retains storage and recovery duties. Observers and adapters also require independent join."

msgid "启动外部 SRAM、已启 watchdog 和保留 RTC 状态不能套用普通关闭。HAL 与自写 实现也不能各自独立推进同一个 live controller 行为域。"
msgstr "External SRAM used at startup, an already enabled watchdog and retained RTC state cannot use ordinary shutdown blindly. HAL and a private implementation also cannot independently advance the same live controller behavior domain."

msgid "当前实现与后续边界"
msgstr "Current implementation and remaining boundaries"

msgid "Board／SoC 不再保留 Python 插件。默认主机工具仍使用 Python 校验与生成静态对象、 只读 plan、按索引选择的固定 typed call 和薄 IRQ 入口；启动、停止、回滚与诊断控制流 由手写 C 维护。既有 `nx_lifecycle_*` 可撤销资源事务与整平台协调器职责不同，不要求 为统一外观把全部驱动改接同一组 ops。"
msgstr "Board and SoC packages contain no Python plugins. The default host tool still uses Python to validate and generate static objects, readonly plans, fixed typed calls selected by index and thin IRQ entries. Handwritten C owns startup, stop, rollback and diagnostic control flow. The existing `nx_lifecycle_*` reversible-resource transactions and the whole-platform coordinator have different responsibilities; a uniform appearance does not require every driver to use the same operations table."

msgid "协调状态保留身份、16-bit 前缀、重入保护和暂停阶段，当前 M4 ELF 为 12 字节；超过 65535 个物理 controller 的 plan 在任何 owner 回调前拒绝。它不改变日常 I/O 热路径；实际资源、 模型行为、ARM 链接和 物理测量各自验收，不能从源码迁移推导整平台通过。"
msgstr "Coordinator state retains identity, a 16-bit prefix, a reentrancy guard and the suspend phase; the current M4 ELF uses 12 bytes. Plans exceeding 65535 physical controllers reject before any owner callback. This does not change the ordinary I/O hot path. Actual resources, model behavior, ARM linking and physical measurements require separate acceptance; moving source code cannot establish whole-platform qualification."

msgid "其他 F4 型号需要精确内存、封装、时钟、DMA、IRQ 与硬件 profile；官方 HAL 覆盖 不建立 Nexus 全系列资格。当前软件验证绑定本次执行，旧记录不继承；物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。精确边界见[支持](support.md)与[资格](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)。"
msgstr "Other F4 parts need exact memory, package, clock, DMA, IRQ and hardware profiles. Official HAL coverage does not establish Nexus series-wide qualification. Current software validation is bound to this execution and does not inherit old records; physical HIL is `not_executed`. See [support](support.md) and [qualification](../reference/platforms/qualification.md) for exact boundaries."

msgid "本页以固定源码 [`a2b74d82`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/a2b74d826dc1545aa8f51b5fcbc05fcd1cc2c984) 及 [PR #61](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/61) 为既有基础，另行记录本轮架构 迭代。既有接口、一次局部修复和整个工作包完成是不同状态；本页不授予新的软件候选 或芯片支持范围。"
msgstr "This page uses fixed source [`a2b74d82`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/a2b74d826dc1545aa8f51b5fcbc05fcd1cc2c984) and [PR #61](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/61) as its existing baseline, while recording the subsequent architecture iteration separately. An existing interface, one local repair and completion of a whole work package are different states. This page grants no new software candidate or chip support."

msgid "根 CMake 只消费 provider 声明的 `NEXUS_SYSTEM_PRIVATE_INCLUDES`，不再硬编码 F4 IP 私有目录；芯片、模式和供应方源码仍由唯一目标图选择，外置 provider 不自动继承 无关 F4 头。构建连接没有增加运行时层，详见[构建合同](../design/build-system.md)。"
msgstr "Root CMake consumes only the provider-declared `NEXUS_SYSTEM_PRIVATE_INCLUDES`, without hardcoded F4 IP private directories. One target graph still selects chip, mode and supplier sources. External providers do not automatically inherit unrelated F4 headers. This build connection adds no runtime layer; see the [build contract](../design/build-system.md)."

msgid "本轮架构迭代任务"
msgstr "Current architecture iteration tasks"

msgid "以下保留已接受的 WP01–WP12 和 IO01–IO20 原始任务编号，替代用旧批次编号推断 当前进度。它是本架构页的人工审查表，不建立另一套配置输入、台账引擎或发布流程。 每个工作包分别说明既有基础、本轮增量和退出条件；只关闭有对应源码与实际执行 证据的子任务，不用一个 GREEN 或公共 API 存在关闭整包。"
msgstr "The accepted WP01–WP12 and IO01–IO20 task IDs below replace assumptions based on IDs from older iterations. This is a human review table within the architecture page, not another configuration input, ledger engine or release process. Each package separates existing foundations, the current increment and exit criteria. Only subtasks with corresponding source and actual execution evidence close; one GREEN or a public API does not close an entire package."

msgid "本轮保持静态 C、共享只读 ops、单一硬件执行者及 ACCEPTED→SETTLED 借用合同。 全部 `vendors/` 保留。应用、产品策略和私有 PCB 继续在外部；实板与远端 Actions 按用户要求暂缓，本地软件门禁仍是必需条件。源码、模型、ARM、SDK、文档和物理 资格继续分开，见[验收边界](qualification.md)。"
msgstr "This iteration retains static C, shared read-only ops, one hardware executor and the ACCEPTED→SETTLED borrow contract. All `vendors/` remain. Applications, product policy and private PCBs stay external. Physical boards and remote Actions are deferred at the user's request; local software gates remain required. Source, models, ARM, SDK, documentation and physical qualification remain distinct; see [acceptance boundaries](qualification.md)."

msgid "工作包、当前状态与退出条件"
msgstr "Work packages, current state and exit criteria"

msgid "工作包"
msgstr "Work package"

msgid "保留的原始子任务"
msgstr "Preserved original subtasks"

msgid "当前状态与退出条件"
msgstr "Current state and exit criteria"

msgid "WP01 基线"
msgstr "WP01 Baseline"

msgid "BL01 固定源码、支持和消费者；BL02 空／单／多实例／DMA 代表配置；BL03 资源、ABI、身份基线；BL04 合同与任务映射"
msgstr "BL01 Pin source, support and consumers; BL02 Empty/single/multiple-instance/DMA representative configurations; BL03 Resource, ABI and identity baselines; BL04 Contract-to-task mapping"

msgid "WP02 精确事实"
msgstr "WP02 Exact facts"

msgid "FT01 统一宏、头和 startup；FT02 控制器／IRQ／DMA 事实去重；FT03 精确器件与封装；FT04 内存与 DMA 域；FT05 具名勘误 profile；FT06 独立手册／SDK 核验"
msgstr "FT01 Unified macros, headers and startup; FT02 Deduplicated controller/IRQ/DMA facts; FT03 Exact devices and packages; FT04 Memory and DMA domains; FT05 Named errata profiles; FT06 Independent manual/SDK checks"

msgid "WP03 配置"
msgstr "WP03 Configuration"

msgid "CF01 统一器件视图；CF02 模式合同；CF03 去首／次 controller 特判；CF04 严格诊断与原子 bundle；CF05 工程模板与接入说明"
msgstr "CF01 Unified device view; CF02 Mode contracts; CF03 Remove first/secondary-controller special cases; CF04 Strict diagnostics and atomic bundles; CF05 Project templates and integration instructions"

msgid "WP04 接口与成本"
msgstr "WP04 Interfaces and cost"

msgid "IF01 强类型 factory 默认；IF02 迁移重复数字入口；IF03 公共接口／可选扩展；IF04 只读资源配置；IF05 配置／状态测量；IF06 编译期特化成本"
msgstr "IF01 Strong factory references by default; IF02 Migrate duplicate numeric entry points; IF03 Public interfaces/optional extensions; IF04 Read-only resource configuration; IF05 Configuration/state measurements; IF06 Compile-time specialization cost"

msgid "实现已有：IF01、IF02、IF03、IF04。集成收口：IF05、IF06。 默认强类型 factory、常规 SDK face／metadata 查询迁移、公共 Nexus 接口及只读连接已有，跨类别误传有 C11／C++17 正负例。底层 scalar switch 保留为唯一实现。IF05、IF06 仍须以同构装配比较状态、配置、Flash／RAM／ABI 和反汇编成本。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: IF01, IF02, IF03, IF04. Integration closure: IF05, IF06. Default strong factory references, migrated ordinary SDK face/metadata lookups, public Nexus interfaces and read-only connections exist. C11/C++17 positive and negative cases cover cross-category misuse. The scalar switch remains the sole underlying implementation. IF05 and IF06 still need state, configuration, Flash/RAM/ABI and disassembly-cost comparisons for equivalent assemblies."

msgid "WP05 共享资源"
msgstr "WP05 Shared resources"

msgid "RS01 共享 IRQ 优先级；RS02 TIM／ADC／CAN／USB 共享域；RS03 DMA 范围、单位、宽度与 FIFO；RS04 取消、迟到 IRQ、失败排空；RS05 部分收条逆序释放；RS06 连续流预算与背压"
msgstr "RS01 Shared IRQ priority; RS02 TIM/ADC/CAN/USB shared domains; RS03 DMA ranges, units, widths and FIFO; RS04 Cancellation, late IRQ and failed drain; RS05 Reverse release of partial receipts; RS06 Continuous-stream budgets and backpressure"

msgid "实现已有：RS01、RS02、RS03、RS04、RS05、RS06。 共享 IRQ／硬件域、DMA 可达性与单位、借用排空、部分收条和有界连续流已有。DAC pending、SDIO 方向化计数／FIFO／IRQ 退出及有限 grace 修正有实际分组证据。新模式仍须覆盖自身冲突、迟到事件、拒撤和耗尽，失败不提前归还存储。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: RS01, RS02, RS03, RS04, RS05, RS06. Shared IRQ/hardware domains, DMA reachability and units, borrow withdrawal, partial receipts and bounded continuous streams exist. DAC pending recovery, directional SDIO counting/FIFO/IRQ withdrawal and finite-grace fixes have actual grouped evidence. Each new mode must still cover its own conflicts, late events, refused withdrawal and exhaustion. Failures never return storage early."

msgid "WP06 Core／OS"
msgstr "WP06 Core/OS"

msgid "OS01 有限 deadline；OS02 启动、停机与换域；OS03 临界区与屏障；OS04 默认 Platform 入口；OS05 裸机推进／RTOS 静态对象；OS06 布局与尺寸"
msgstr "OS01 Finite deadlines; OS02 Startup, shutdown and time-domain changes; OS03 Critical sections and barriers; OS04 Default Platform entry; OS05 Bare-metal progress/static RTOS objects; OS06 Layout and size"

msgid "WP07 系统"
msgstr "WP07 System"

msgid "SY01 时钟、供电与 Flash latency；SY02 回退实际频率；SY03 启动、CCM、外部 SRAM；SY04 STOP／Standby；SY05 恢复时间桥接；SY06 故障记录与恢复"
msgstr "SY01 Clocks, supply and Flash latency; SY02 Actual fallback frequency; SY03 Startup, CCM and external SRAM; SY04 STOP/Standby; SY05 Recovery time bridging; SY06 Fault recording and recovery"

msgid "实现已有：SY01、SY02、SY03、SY04、SY05、SY06。 静态 ClockPlan 与实际 HCLK 回退、pre-C／CCM／外部 SRAM、受约束 STOP／Standby、显式 deadline bridge 和首故障记录均已有。桥接使用独立 elapsed bounds，不自动恢复 OS 任务或继承旧 deadline。继续保持实际回读、失败收条和新时间域，产品恢复及物理验证独立。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: SY01, SY02, SY03, SY04, SY05, SY06. Static ClockPlan and actual-HCLK fallback, pre-C/CCM/external SRAM, constrained STOP/Standby, explicit deadline bridging and first-fault records exist. The bridge uses independent elapsed bounds; it does not automatically restore OS tasks or reuse old deadlines. Preserve hardware readback, failed-cleanup receipts and new time domains. Product recovery and physical validation remain separate."

msgid "WP08 驱动"
msgstr "WP08 Drivers"

msgid "DR01 完整模式 HAL／LL；DR02 拆无关外设依赖；DR03 同 IP 行为复用；DR04 I/O 全清单；DR05 删除已有可靠替代的旧实现"
msgstr "DR01 HAL/LL for complete modes; DR02 Separate unrelated peripheral dependencies; DR03 Reuse behavior for the same IP; DR04 Complete I/O checklist; DR05 Remove old implementations with verified replacements"

msgid "实现已有：DR02、DR03、DR05。集成收口：DR01。后续实现／交接：DR04。 无关外设头隔离、同 IP 共享 C／只读 ops，以及有可靠替代的旧入口收敛已有。DR01 继续按完整模式审查官方库复用与直接访问理由，不机械替换所有寄存器操作。DR04 仍需下表明确的新模式与新 IP，沿既有接收、错误、取消和排空合同扩展。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: DR02, DR03, DR05. Integration closure: DR01. Further implementation/handoff: DR04. Unrelated-header isolation, shared C/read-only ops for the same IP and consolidation of old entries with reliable replacements exist. DR01 reviews official-library reuse and direct-access reasons per complete mode; mechanically replacing every register operation is unnecessary. DR04 still needs the new modes and IP explicitly listed below, extending existing receive, error, cancellation and withdrawal contracts."

msgid "WP09 Board／组件"
msgstr "WP09 Boards/components"

msgid "BD01 原理图与安全电平；BD02 未知 PCB／跳线显式；BD03 组件使用公共 endpoint；BD04 中间件按需"
msgstr "BD01 Schematics and safe levels; BD02 Explicit unknown PCB/jumper facts; BD03 Components use public endpoints; BD04 Optional middleware"

msgid "实现已有：BD01、BD02、BD03、BD04。 四份独立 Board 事实与安全电平、显式未知 PCB／跳线、公共 endpoint 器件组件及按需中间件已有。当前不扩大接线或实装声明，不猜测未知事实。未选择的中间件不进入产物，组件不含厂商寄存器；实板暂缓不阻塞这些软件机制。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: BD01, BD02, BD03, BD04. Four separate Board fact sets and safe levels, explicit PCB/jumper unknowns, device components using public endpoints and optional middleware exist. Wiring and fitted-hardware claims are not expanded; do not guess unknown facts. Unselected middleware stays outside artifacts, and components contain no vendor registers. Deferred physical boards do not block these software mechanisms."

msgid "WP10 构建／SDK"
msgstr "WP10 Build/SDK"

msgid "BU01 根 CMake 去 F4 私有目录；BU02 模式／IP 选编；BU03 私有 SDK 配置／callback ABI；BU04 SDK 精确器件闭包；BU05 外部消费者"
msgstr "BU01 Remove F4 private directories from root CMake; BU02 Mode/IP source selection; BU03 Private SDK configuration/callback ABI; BU04 Exact-device SDK closure; BU05 External consumers"

msgid "WP11 家族扩展"
msgstr "WP11 Family extension"

msgid "FM01 F405／F407／F415／F417 差异复用；FM02 缺失外设／封装负例；FM03 其余 F4 按 IP 扩展；FM04 新 IP"
msgstr "FM01 Reuse with F405/F407/F415/F417 differences; FM02 Missing-peripheral/package negative cases; FM03 Other F4 parts by IP; FM04 New IP"

msgid "WP12 验证／交付"
msgstr "WP12 Verification/delivery"

msgid "QA01 合同与差异测试精简；QA02 真实 TDD；QA03 ARM、资源与编译上下文；QA04 完整正常门禁和审查；QA05 文档、图、示例与矩阵；QA06 软件候选与版本"
msgstr "QA01 Focused contract/differential tests; QA02 Actual TDD; QA03 ARM, resources and compiler contexts; QA04 Complete normal gates and review; QA05 Documentation, diagrams, examples and matrices; QA06 Software candidate and version"

msgid "实现已有：QA02。集成收口：QA01、QA03、QA04、QA05、QA06。 真实 TDD 约束与本轮实际 RED／GREEN 记录已有。测试保留审查、最终 ARM／资源、正常完整门禁、双语文档／SDK 及候选身份仍须收口，继续复用现有工具。HIL 合成记录测试属于工装验证，不是实板执行；保留原始失败，不缩减正式计划或重标资格。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: QA02. Integration closure: QA01, QA03, QA04, QA05, QA06. The TDD requirement and this iteration's actual RED/GREEN records exist. Test-retention review, final ARM/resources, ordinary complete gates, bilingual documentation/SDK and candidate identity still need closure. Reuse existing tools. Synthetic HIL-record tests validate tooling, not physical boards. Preserve original failures without reducing formal plans or relabeling qualification."

msgid "I/O 覆盖与未完成边界"
msgstr "I/O coverage and remaining boundaries"

msgid "这里按原任务覆盖全部二十类 I/O；具体可选择模式仍以[精确支持](support.md)、 [派生能力](capabilities.md)及各领域合同为准。本表不增加第二份能力事实，不把一次 协议或 DMA 修正解释成该类所有功能已经完成。"
msgstr "These original task IDs cover all twenty I/O categories. Selectable modes remain governed by [exact support](support.md), [derived capabilities](capabilities.md) and domain contracts. This table adds no second fact authority and never treats one protocol or DMA repair as completion of every function in that category."

msgid "编号"
msgstr "ID"

msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

msgid "既有基础与本轮边界"
msgstr "Existing foundations and current boundaries"

msgid "IO01"
msgstr "IO01"

msgid "GPIO／EXTI"
msgstr "GPIO/EXTI"

msgid "已有输入、输出、IRQ 事件与 EMR 硬件事件；封装、电气、PC13／LSE 和 Board 授权继续受约束，本轮未关闭全类复核。"
msgstr "Input, output, IRQ events and EMR hardware events exist. Package, electrical, PC13/LSE and Board authorization constraints remain; the whole-category review is not closed."

msgid "IO02"
msgstr "IO02"

msgid "UART／USART"
msgstr "UART/USART"

msgid "IO03"
msgstr "IO03"

msgid "SPI"
msgstr "SPI"

msgid "IO04"
msgstr "IO04"

msgid "I2C"
msgstr "I2C"

msgid "已有 master、target 与 SMBus 的选定合同；器件事实、时钟、首／次实例和异常恢复仍须统一核对。"
msgstr "Selected master, target and SMBus contracts exist. Device facts, clocks, first/secondary instances and abnormal recovery still require unified checks."

msgid "IO05"
msgstr "IO05"

msgid "TIM"
msgstr "TIM"

msgid "已有计数、PWM、捕获、编码器及有限波形；共享时基、触发、break 与 DMA burst 不能由单一实例的通过值代替。"
msgstr "Counting, PWM, capture, encoders and finite waveforms exist. One passing instance cannot establish shared timebase, trigger, break and DMA-burst combinations."

msgid "IO06"
msgstr "IO06"

msgid "ADC"
msgstr "ADC"

msgid "已有单次、scan、注入和多 ADC 模式。本轮补充完整 provider／事实／buffer 的别名拒绝及有限 warmup／drain；SUCCESS 表示接纳，借用后的故障继续保留退出责任。regular／injected 并行、自动注入和循环多 ADC 仍未提供。"
msgstr "Single-shot, scan, injected and multi-ADC modes exist. This increment adds concrete-provider/fact/buffer alias rejection and finite warmup/drain handling. SUCCESS means acceptance; post-borrow failures retain withdrawal responsibility. Parallel regular/injected operation, automatic injection and circular multi-ADC remain unavailable."

msgid "IO07"
msgstr "IO07"

msgid "DAC"
msgstr "DAC"

msgid "已有 CPU／触发／DMA 和波形路径；本轮跨 request 的 pending／underrun 恢复增量已有 C 模型、ARM 和独立审查，不能据此关闭整个 DAC 类别，也不承诺模拟无毛刺或持续保持输出。"
msgstr "CPU/trigger/DMA and waveform paths exist. The current pending/underrun recovery increment across requests has C-model, ARM and independent review evidence. It does not close the entire DAC category or promise glitch-free analog behavior or continuous output hold."

msgid "IO08"
msgstr "IO08"

msgid "I2S／音频"
msgstr "I2S/audio"

msgid "有限与连续 blocks 已在基线；外部 clock 上界、service 预算、补充 buffer 与 RX loan 的独立 join 仍是调用方责任，不计为本轮新完成项。"
msgstr "Finite and continuous blocks are in the baseline. External clock bounds, service budgets, buffer replenishment and independent RX-loan joining remain caller duties, not newly completed work in this iteration."

msgid "IO09"
msgstr "IO09"

msgid "CAN"
msgstr "CAN"

msgid "已有 CAN1／2 classic、邮箱和共享 filter domain；共享依赖、bus-off 与恢复仍按具体模式验收，不授予 CAN FD。"
msgstr "CAN1/2 classic, mailboxes and shared filter domains exist. Shared dependencies, bus-off and recovery retain per-mode acceptance; CAN FD is not granted."

msgid "IO10"
msgstr "IO10"

msgid "SDIO"
msgstr "SDIO"

msgid "IO11"
msgstr "IO11"

msgid "FSMC／FMC"
msgstr "FSMC/FMC"

msgid "基线仅提供已声明的 F407 FSMC 内存／设备模式；FMC 及其他器件的能力不从名称相近推导。"
msgstr "The baseline provides only declared F407 FSMC memory/device modes. Similar names do not imply FMC or other-device capabilities."

msgid "IO12"
msgstr "IO12"

msgid "USB Device"
msgstr "USB Device"

msgid "IO13"
msgstr "IO13"

msgid "USB Host／角色"
msgstr "USB Host/roles"

msgid "基线已有 host 和显式角色、reset／resume 保持合同；不扩为自动 OTG 协商，也不以模型证明 VBUS／PHY／实物枚举。"
msgstr "Host, explicit roles and reset/resume minimum-hold contracts exist in the baseline. They do not expand to automatic OTG negotiation, and models do not prove VBUS/PHY/physical enumeration."

msgid "IO14"
msgstr "IO14"

msgid "Ethernet"
msgstr "Ethernet"

msgid "基线已有 raw／增强帧、MII／RMII 与计划驱动的 MDC／PTP；计数分辨率不是物理精度或网络同步资格。"
msgstr "Raw/enhanced frames, MII/RMII and plan-derived MDC/PTP exist in the baseline. Counter resolution is not physical accuracy or network-synchronization qualification."

msgid "IO15"
msgstr "IO15"

msgid "DCMI"
msgstr "DCMI"

msgid "已有 RAW／JPEG snapshot 与 RAW blocks；本轮补充配置、引脚事实和恢复 snapshot 与控制／DMA 存储的别名拒绝。连续 JPEG 仍无装配模式；帧事件不保证精确图像边界或帧数，摄像头接线尚未物理验证。"
msgstr "RAW/JPEG snapshots and RAW blocks exist. This increment rejects control/DMA-storage aliases with configuration, pin facts and restoration snapshots. Continuous JPEG still has no assembly mode. Frame events do not guarantee exact image boundaries or frame counts, and camera wiring has not been physically verified."

msgid "IO16"
msgstr "IO16"

msgid "RTC"
msgstr "RTC"

msgid "基线已有日历、备份、晶体 PC13 静默及 INIT／tamper 勘误；timestamp／tamper 需要明确 bypass 事实，不把四板晶体配置解释成外部时钟输入。"
msgstr "Calendar, backup, crystal-PC13 quietness and INIT/tamper errata handling exist in the baseline. Timestamp/tamper needs explicit bypass facts; four crystal Board configurations do not become external-clock inputs."

msgid "IO17"
msgstr "IO17"

msgid "Flash 维护"
msgstr "Flash maintenance"

msgid "基线已有精确几何、不可逆维护及显式 recover；本轮不把旧修复再计完成，不自动回滚、重放或替代 POR。"
msgstr "Exact geometry, irreversible maintenance and explicit recover exist in the baseline. Old fixes are not counted again, and there is no automatic rollback, replay or substitute for POR."

msgid "IO18"
msgstr "IO18"

msgid "监督／故障"
msgstr "Supervision/faults"

msgid "已有 IWDG／WWDG、CSS、复位与故障观察机制；安全输出、真实复位、掉电及产品恢复仍分别验收。"
msgstr "IWDG/WWDG, CSS, reset and fault-observation mechanisms exist. Safe outputs, actual reset, power loss and product recovery retain separate acceptance."

msgid "IO19"
msgstr "IO19"

msgid "RNG／CRC／身份"
msgstr "RNG/CRC/identity"

msgid "已有 RNG、固定 CRC 字序列与实际身份查询；新具名勘误 profile 不扩大器件范围，UID 不作为秘密，REV_ID 准入不证明 PCB 或封装。"
msgstr "RNG, fixed CRC word sequences and actual identity queries exist. A named errata profile does not expand device support. UID is no secret; REV_ID admission proves neither PCB nor package."

msgid "IO20"
msgstr "IO20"

msgid "其他 F4 IP"
msgstr "Other F4 IP"

msgid "SAI、LTDC、DMA2D、QSPI、CRYP、HASH 的完整 provider 尚未接入当前生产范围；须经 FM03／FM04 选择精确器件、模式和硬件域后逐项实施。"
msgstr "Complete SAI, LTDC, DMA2D, QSPI, CRYP and HASH providers are not integrated into the current production scope. FM03/FM04 must select exact devices, modes and hardware domains before implementing each one."

msgid "任务结果只在该子项的退出条件满足后更新。未完成项保留原编号和边界，后续改动 继续进入现有源码、合同、测试和 CMake／SDK 路径；不以新增目录、空壳测试或另一套 通用注册机制代替实现。"
msgstr "Task results change only after that subtask meets its exit criteria. Remaining tasks retain their IDs and boundaries. Further changes use the existing source, contracts, tests and CMake/SDK paths; new directories, empty tests or another generic registry never substitute for implementation."

msgid "Nexus 提供静态 C11 通用机制。当前生产 SoC 入口只有 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`； [精确支持](support.md)区分五个已审料号、四个 F407 Board 和新增内部 CRC 软件参考。 系列源码复用不等于每个模式都已执行。厂商依赖保留，只有实际选中闭包进入准备、 校验、编译与 SDK。"
msgstr "Nexus provides static C11 mechanisms. The sole production SoC entry is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`. [Exact support](support.md) distinguishes five reviewed parts, four F407 Boards and added internal-CRC software references. Sharing family source does not mean every mode has executed. Vendor dependencies remain; only the selected closure enters preparation, validation, compilation and SDKs."

msgid "本轮 F4 输入先由 `variants.<part>.device` 选择唯一 device profile，再组合不重叠 controller groups；不可变 `DeviceView` 分开表达物理 `ControllerFacts` 和软件 `ControllerModes`。配置与查询共用所选事实，家族展示与 Host-only 审核索引不反向 授权单颗器件。具名资料 profile 只在中央主机模块校验受审身份与适用性，不增加 MCU registry，详见[接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)。"
msgstr "F4 inputs select one device profile through `variants.<part>.device`, then compose disjoint controller groups. The immutable `DeviceView` separates physical `ControllerFacts` from software `ControllerModes`. Resolution and queries use the same selected facts; family displays and Host-only audit indexes do not authorize another device. Named reference profiles validate reviewed identity and applicability in the central host module without an MCU registry; see the [porting guide](../guides/provider-porting.md)."

msgid "下表区分已有实现、集成收口与后续实现／交接。已有实现限定为所列精确器件与 已声明模式的源码和合同；F407 模式回归不自动扩展到新增料号。集成收口表示机制 已存在，需要最终同一源码的执行、测量或独立核对。后续项按具体缺失行为、器件、 IP 推进。当前未宣布整个 F4 全功能或十二包全部完成；实板暂缓不等于已有软件 机制未实现。"
msgstr "The table separates existing implementation, integration closure and remaining implementation/handoff. Existing implementation means source and contracts for the listed exact devices and declared modes; F407 mode regressions do not automatically cover added parts. Integration closure means the mechanism exists but still needs final-source execution, measurement or independent review. Remaining work is specific behavior, devices or IP. Neither every F4 function nor all twelve packages is declared complete. Deferred hardware work does not mean existing software mechanisms are missing."

msgid "实现已有：BL01、BL02、BL04。集成收口：BL03。 固定源码、20 项消费者策略及空／单／多实例／DMA 代表装配均已有；本页保留合同映射。BL03 仍须以最终相同输入、工具和 ABI 汇总资源身份，不能把历史测量重标为新候选。"
msgstr "Existing implementation: BL01, BL02, BL04. Integration closure: BL03. Pinned source, one 20-consumer policy, empty/single/multiple-instance/DMA representative assemblies and this contract mapping exist. BL03 still needs a resource identity summary for identical final inputs, tools and ABI. Historical measurements cannot be relabeled as a new candidate."

msgid "实现已有：FT01、FT02、FT03、FT04、FT05、FT06（当前五料号事实）。精确宏／startup、封装／内存／DMA 域、67 项共同 controller 与 ETH／DCMI 差异组、具名资料 profile 和独立手册／SDK 核验已有。IRQ enum／number／handler 分别核对，AF 表与封装交集有正负例；当前 ARM CRC 和开发 SDK 不授予全部模式或 PCB 资格。"
msgstr "Implemented: FT01–FT06 for the current five-part facts. Exact macros/startup, packages/memory/DMA domains, 67 common controllers and separate ETH/DCMI groups, named reference profiles and independent manual/SDK checks exist. IRQ enum, number and handler are checked separately; AF tables and package intersections have positive/negative cases. Current ARM CRC and development-SDK evidence do not qualify every mode or PCB."

msgid "实现已有：CF01、CF02、CF03、CF04、CF05。DeviceView、模式合同、严格诊断／原子 bundle 与模板已有。CF03 删除 SPI peer 选择和 UART preload 特判，同一 C cold 路径保存 IRQ 优先级、失败 CR／GPIO／gate 和正常 pin owner；实际 SPI 34＋10、UART wire 12 项回归分别绑定源码。最终完整工具域与候选仍待集成，不把局部通过当全模式资格。"
msgstr "Implemented: CF01–CF05. DeviceView, mode contracts, strict diagnostics/atomic bundles and templates exist. CF03 removes SPI peer selection and UART preload special cases. One C cold path preserves IRQ priorities, failed-prepare CR/GPIO/gate restoration and normal pin ownership. Actual SPI 34+10 and UART wire 12 regressions are bound to their source. Final complete tool domains and candidate integration remain pending; focused success is not all-mode qualification."

msgid "实现已有：OS01、OS02、OS03、OS04、OS05、OS06。有限预算、停机换域、mask／屏障、同一 Platform 协调器及静态 RTOS 已有。本轮继续闭合串行／HAL／Ethernet 的有限排空、RS485 最低 hold 故障保留与 UART 配置归还后幂等 stop；实际布局与整程序有证据。新增候选仍须统一门禁，不授予全部 CPU／后端组合。"
msgstr "Implemented: OS01–OS06. Finite budgets, shutdown/domain changes, masks/barriers, the same Platform coordinator and static RTOS objects exist. This increment also closes finite serial/HAL/Ethernet drains, retained RS485 minimum-hold faults and idempotent UART stop after configuration return. Actual layouts and whole-program execution are recorded. A new candidate still requires unified gates and does not qualify every CPU/backend combination."

msgid "实现已有：BU01、BU02、BU03、BU04。集成收口：BU05。provider 私有 include、模式／IP 选源、私有 SDK／callback ABI 与五料号精确头／startup 选择已有。模型无变化重写修复是独立构建优化，不替代 BU02。新增三料号开发 SDK 实际消费不等于最终 clean-source 候选；BU05 仍须由最终包完成既定 20 项消费者。"
msgstr "Implemented: BU01–BU04. Integration closure: BU05. Provider-private includes, mode/IP source selection, private SDK/callback ABI and exact header/startup selection for five parts exist. Avoiding unchanged model-file rewrites is a separate build optimization, not BU02. Actual development-SDK consumption for three added parts is not the final clean-source candidate; BU05 still requires the established 20 consumers from the final package."

msgid "实现已有：FM01、FM02（F405ZG／F407VE／F407ZG／F415ZG／F417ZG）。后续实现：FM03、FM04。共同 IP、ETH／DCMI 差异、独立 IRQ／AF／资料核验及缺失外设／封装负例已有；新增型号以 HSI16／内部 CRC 软件参考取得 ARM 与开发 SDK 证据，不声明实体 PCB 或全部模式。其他 F4 和新 IP 仍需逐项接入。"
msgstr "Implemented: FM01/FM02 for F405ZG, F407VE, F407ZG, F415ZG and F417ZG. Remaining implementation: FM03/FM04. Common IP, ETH/DCMI differences, independent IRQ/AF/reference checks and missing-peripheral/package negative cases exist. Added parts have ARM and development-SDK evidence through HSI16/internal-CRC software references, without physical-PCB or all-mode claims. Other F4 parts and new IP still require individual integration."

msgid "已有选定格式、线模式及轮询／IRQ／DMA。本轮统一 UART idle cold 规则、RX／duplex 不可变资源与别名准入，有限排空及重复 stop 不再访问已归还配置；RS485 无法证明最低 hold 时保留 DE／outer loan。全部控制器／格式组合仍按模式验收。"
msgstr "Selected formats, wire modes and polling/IRQ/DMA exist. This increment unifies UART cold-idle rules, immutable RX/duplex resources and alias admission, finite drains and repeated stop without accessing returned configuration. RS485 retains DE/outer loans when minimum hold cannot be proved. Every controller/format combination remains mode-specific qualification."

msgid "已有主／从、帧事务与 DMA。SPI1／2／3 DMA 统一 cold prepare／close，不再根据 peer 存在选择算法；优先级、失败 CR 恢复、CS／pin owner 有实际回归。有限 framed drain／tail 已修正，新增模式仍需自身尾部与取消证据。"
msgstr "Master/slave, framed transactions and DMA exist. SPI1/2/3 DMA share one cold prepare/close path without selecting an algorithm by peer presence. Priority, failed-prepare CR restoration and CS/pin ownership have actual regressions. Finite framed drain/tail budgets are corrected; new modes still need their own tail and cancellation evidence."

msgid "已有 SD／MMC 与 SDIO functions。本轮完成 RX PFCTRL／TX 精确计数与 FIFO／IRQ join、memory CMD18／25＋CMD12／13 及静态 ClockPlan 的 RM／勘误联合分频；默认与低 PCLK2 实际程序及 ARM 对象通过。HS／DDR／HS200、linked candidate 和物理资格不在此通过范围。"
msgstr "SD/MMC and SDIO functions exist. This increment implements RX PFCTRL/TX exact counts and FIFO/IRQ joins, memory CMD18/25 plus CMD12/13, and static-ClockPlan dividers jointly checked against the reference manual and errata. Actual default/low-PCLK2 programs and ARM objects pass. HS/DDR/HS200, a linked candidate and physical qualification are outside that result."

msgid "已有 FS／HS、PIO／DMA 和受约束端点。本轮增加同 epoch 提前 STATUS OUT 与 DATA IN 并存；wire 关闭不撤内存借用，packetizer／ST Core 先双方向 join，禁止旧 IN 续包。实际最终整程序与候选仍按新源码收口；remote wake／高带宽 ISO 未接入。"
msgstr "FS/HS, PIO/DMA and constrained endpoint modes exist. This increment adds same-epoch early STATUS OUT alongside DATA IN. Wire closure does not revoke memory borrows; the packetizer/ST Core join both directions and prohibit further old IN packets. Final whole-program execution and candidate closure remain bound to new source. Remote wake and high-bandwidth ISO are not integrated."
